  (text "Pins occupied when quad Flash/PSRAM is used 2MB PSRAM\nThese are S3 chip pins, not wroom module pins!\nPIN28/GPIO26/SPICS1\nPIN30/GPIO27/SPIHD\nPIN31/GPIO28/SPIWP\nPIN32/GPIO29/SPICS0\nPIN33/GPIO30/SPICLK\nPIN34/GPIO31/SPIQ\nPIN35/GPIO32/SPID\n\nPins occupied when octal Flash/PSRAM is used 8MB PSRAM\nThese are S3 chip pins, not wroom module pins!\nPIN28/GPIO26/SPI_CS1 \nPIN30/GPIO27/SPI_HD\nPIN31/GPIO28/SPI_WP\nPIN32/GPIO29/SPI_CS0\nPIN33/GPIO30/SPI_CLK\nPIN34/GPIO31/SPI_Q\nPIN35/GPIO32/SPI_D\nPIN38/GPIO33/SPI_IO4\nPIN39/GPIO34/SPI_IO5\nPIN40/GPIO35/SPI_IO6\nPIN41/GPIO36/SPI_IO7\nPIN42/GPIO37/SPI_DQS"
    (at 147.955 173.99 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 0d39b645-a2a0-4ed1-a101-3e81bd3aee21)
  )
